@sheet Data
@header | Amount | Qty |
| 3 | 1 |
| 4 | 2 |
| 5 | 3 |

@sheet CalcA
@header | Metric | Value |
| Sum amount | =SUM(!!Amount) |

@sheet CalcB
@header | Metric | Value |
| Sum qty | =SUM(!!Qty) |
| Ratio | =SUM(!!Amount)/SUM(!!Qty) |

@sheet Final
@header | Metric | Value |
| Combined | =CalcA!B2+CalcB!B2 |
| Ratio x10 | =CalcB!B3*10 |
